WEBVTT

00:05:58.160 --> 00:06:00.398
and even transform government buildings,

00:06:00.422 --> 00:06:03.683
so that there is space
inside of them for them.

00:06:03.707 --> 00:06:05.514
Before we had PB,

00:06:05.538 --> 00:06:07.958
I would see people who look like me

00:06:07.982 --> 00:06:09.523
and come from where I come from

00:06:09.547 --> 00:06:12.824
walk in to government buildings
for this new initiative

00:06:12.848 --> 00:06:14.609
or that new working group,

00:06:14.633 --> 00:06:17.172
and then I'd watch them
walk right back out.

00:06:17.641 --> 00:06:19.934
Sometimes I wouldn't see them again.

00:06:20.379 --> 00:06:24.498
It's because their expertise
was being unvalued.

00:06:24.522 --> 00:06:27.820
They weren't truly
being engaged in the process.

00:06:27.844 --> 00:06:30.494
Put PB is different.